  "description": "Sovereign Verified Agency (SVA) Open Standards: SVA-ER/1, VSC/1, EMA/1 — zero-dependency tri-runtime conformance (Node.js, W3C WebCrypto, single-file Java WASM VM) & offline browser playgrounds",
